{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nWhere the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nThe procurement policy states that a single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR. [[cite:obs-42c64e18fc70d2363dd4726a6fc1332ff041f3ab \"A single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\")]]\n","expected_sha256":"34cb573315fc08aa9b96c20e0d30ca61e96a7722c20d4d2d14b7eb8aa29c61c0","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Kept the single-signature purchase limit as 1000 EUR per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026, which overrides the procurement policy limit of 2000 EUR, with exact citations for each statement as required."}